# Own-wording subclasses of Grim Hollow Player's Guide (2024): Rogue, Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard.
_MIS = [
 ["Curse of the Befuddled", "**Cost 2 Jinx Points.** Magic action on a creature you see within 60 ft that your Evil Eye curses. It makes a Wisdom save and on a fail is Charmed for 10 minutes, ending early if you or your allies damage it. It knows afterward that you charmed it. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Clumsy", "**Cost 3 Jinx Points.** Reaction when a creature cursed by your Evil Eye moves at least 5 ft on its turn: it falls Prone and its Speed is 0 until the end of that turn. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Debilitated", "**Cost 1 Jinx Point.** Reaction when a creature cursed by your Evil Eye takes damage: it takes Necrotic damage equal to a roll of 1d12. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Doomed", "**Cost 1 Jinx Point.** Reaction when you miss a creature cursed by your Evil Eye with an attack roll: reroll the attack and keep the new result. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Fearful", "**Cost 2 Jinx Points.** Magic action on a creature you see within 60 ft that your Evil Eye curses. It makes a Wisdom save and on a fail is Frightened for 1 minute. At the end of each of its turns it repeats the save and ends the effect on a success. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Inept", "**Cost 1 Jinx Point.** Reaction after a creature you see that is cursed by your Evil Eye makes a D20 Test: it rerolls and must use the new roll. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Insensate", "**Cost 3 Jinx Points.** Magic action on a creature you see that your Evil Eye curses. It makes a Wisdom save and on a fail is Blinded and Deafened for 1 minute. At the end of each of its turns it repeats the save and ends the effect on a success. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Maimed", "**Cost 2 Jinx Points.** Reaction when you hit a creature cursed by your Evil Eye with a weapon or Unarmed Strike attack and roll 19 or 20 on the d20: the hit is a Critical Hit. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Marked", "**Cost 2 Jinx Points.** Bonus Action: your Evil Eye on its current target lasts 1 hour instead, or until you curse a different creature with it. While the curse lasts, you know the direction and distance to that creature as long as you share a plane."],
 ["Curse of the Plagued", "**Cost 1 Jinx Point.** Reaction when a creature you see that is cursed by your Evil Eye would regain HP: it regains half as many. It also cannot regain HP until the start of your next turn. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Somnolent", "**Cost 3 Jinx Points.** Magic action on a creature you see that your Evil Eye curses. It makes a Wisdom save and on a fail is Unconscious for 1 minute. The effect ends if it takes damage or someone within 5 ft uses an action to shake it awake. Creatures that do not sleep, such as elves, and creatures immune to Exhaustion pass the save automatically. The creature then stops being cursed by your Evil Eye."],
 ["Curse of the Unlucky", "**Cost 3 Jinx Points.** Bonus Action on a creature cursed by your Evil Eye. Whenever it is about to make an attack roll or saving throw, you can roll 1d4 and subtract the result from its total. This ends when the creature is no longer cursed by your Evil Eye."],
]

